ked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.4-beta3, 4.3-stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows\n\n### Issue description\n\nTurning off the \"Use Windows Ink\" option in the Wacom driver breaks pressure support in Godot with default settings. Godot always defaults to \"winink\" driver in the project settings, but this silently breaks when this option is unset.\n\nI should note that this configuration is not that niche, since it is easily reachable in the Wacom driver GUI and is recommended by at least 1 popular youtube video.\n\nThis hasn't caused an issue for me in either Krita or Blender.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Using a wacom driver, turn off \"Use Windows Ink\" in driver settings.\n2. Print `InputEventMouseMotion.pressure` and note values are either 0 or 1.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102740/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart"